WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.226
GST replaced a tangle of

2
00:00:02.226 --> 00:00:04.434
central and state taxes.

3
00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:05.899
And it created a council

4
00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:07.470
where neither side can win

5
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:08.388
alone.

6
00:00:08.716 --> 00:00:11.850
The hundred-and-first amendment came in

7
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.394
2016. GST began on the

8
00:00:14.394 --> 00:00:16.080
first of July,

9
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.153
2017.

10
00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:19.795
The Union Finance Minister chairs

11
00:00:19.795 --> 00:00:21.239
the GST Council.

12
00:00:21.239 --> 00:00:23.433
Every state's finance minister sits

13
00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:24.427
on it.

14
00:00:24.743 --> 00:00:26.860
A decision needs a three-quarter

15
00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.979
majority of weighted votes.

16
00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:30.622
The Centre's vote counts for

17
00:00:30.622 --> 00:00:32.882
one-third, the states' for two-thirds.

18
00:00:32.882 --> 00:00:34.755
So neither can pass anything

19
00:00:34.755 --> 00:00:35.710
alone.

20
00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:37.218
Your turn.

21
00:00:37.218 --> 00:00:38.755
How much does the Centre's

22
00:00:38.755 --> 00:00:39.974
vote weigh?
